          "text": "Reported respiratory and associated symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports ongoing shortness of breath, recently worsened over approximately 1–2 days; says the treatment is not working and she cannot walk to the letterbox. Feels unable to get a full breath and reports some chest tightness. Mild light-headedness on exertion only; no syncope. No fever, cough, haemoptysis, or pleuritic pain today. Reports no current chest pain."
      }
