        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Focused examination findings"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "General: anxious, talking in full sentences, but clearly puffed after walking in from the waiting room. Chest: mild tachypnoea; chest clear, no wheeze, no focal crackles, good air entry, no rub. Cardiovascular: heart sounds dual, no added sounds, JVP not raised, no peripheral oedema, capillary refill under 2 seconds. Calves: left greater than right mild swelling, non-tender, no erythema or warmth; described as per previous baseline. Abdomen: soft, mild diffuse tenderness only, no peritonism."
      }
    },
